Package: polifonia
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Polifonia Contributors <info@polifonia.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/Taoshan98/polifonia
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libdbus-1-3, libwayland-client0 | libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libegl1, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, pipewire-bin, wireplumber, pulseaudio-utils
Description: Multi-Speaker & Multi-Monitor Audio Unison Engine for Linux
 Polifonia Audio Studio is a native Rust PipeWire audio compositing and
 acoustic synchronization studio console that broadcasts phase-aligned,
 latency-compensated audio simultaneously across monitors, USB DACs,
 S/PDIF receivers, Bluetooth A2DP, and network speakers.
